# shadowssh
===
 A fast, modern SSH client for Linux with multi-tab sessions, SFTP file browser, SSH key generation, jump host support, and a built-in VPS Desktop GUI manager powered by SMD. Supports XFCE, MATE, GNOME, KDE, and Cinnamon installation on remote servers.
